{"page":1001,"blocks":[{"x":0.6637,"y":0.05257,"w":0.28781,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"16.4 Green’s Theorem in the Plane 987"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.09345,"w":0.59312,"h":0.08952,"fs":0.01279,"n":6,"k":1,"t":"defined by the line integral on the left-hand side of Equation (3), is the integral of its rate of change (circulation density) over the region R enclosed by C, which is the double inte- gral on the right-hand side of Equation (3). Likewise, the outward flux of F across C, defined by the line integral on the left-hand side of Equation (4), is the integral of its rate of change (flux density) over the region R enclosed by C, which is the double integral on the right-hand side of Equation (4)."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.20429,"w":0.50256,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"EXAMPLE 3 Verify both forms of Green’s Theorem for the vector field"},{"x":0.57754,"y":0.23472,"w":0.15904,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"F(x, y) = (x - y)i + xj"},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.26481,"w":0.28236,"h":0.01281,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"and the region R bounded by the unit circle"},{"x":0.50595,"y":0.29355,"w":0.30222,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"C: r(t) = (cos t)i + (sin t)j, 0 … t … 2p."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.32663,"w":0.59308,"h":0.02899,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"k":1,"t":"Solution Evaluating F(r(t)) and computing the partial derivatives of the components of F, we have"},{"x":0.48641,"y":0.37157,"w":0.34472,"h":0.03266,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":0,"t":"M = cos t - sin t, dx = d(cos t) = -sin t dt, N = cos t, dy = d(sin t) = cos t dt,"},{"x":0.48618,"y":0.41041,"w":0.34813,"h":0.02729,"fs":0.01279,"n":9,"k":0,"t":"0M 0x = 1, 0M 0y = - 1, 0N 0x = 1, 0N 0y = 0."},{"x":0.36259,"y":0.45537,"w":0.21882,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"The two sides of Equation (3) are"},{"x":0.57958,"y":0.48526,"w":0.02667,"h":0.00943,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"t=2p"},{"x":0.44976,"y":0.49818,"w":0.10485,"h":0.01346,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"M dx + N dy ="},{"x":0.60629,"y":0.49818,"w":0.28745,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"(cos t - sin t)(-sin t dt) + (cos t)(cos t dt)"},{"x":0.43016,"y":0.50968,"w":0.01792,"h":0.01953,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"F C"},{"x":0.57222,"y":0.51352,"w":0.01862,"h":0.00943,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"t=0"},{"x":0.57964,"y":0.53898,"w":0.01377,"h":0.00943,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"2p"},{"x":0.57228,"y":0.55189,"w":0.19866,"h":0.02478,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"0 (-sin t cos t + 1) dt = 2p"},{"x":0.41781,"y":0.59201,"w":0.02606,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"a0N"},{"x":0.42861,"y":0.59201,"w":0.12612,"h":0.0305,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"0x - 0M dy b dx dy ="},{"x":0.58946,"y":0.60177,"w":0.11273,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(1 - (-1)) dx dy"},{"x":0.39121,"y":0.61328,"w":0.02251,"h":0.01952,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"O R"},{"x":0.5645,"y":0.61328,"w":0.02251,"h":0.01952,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"O R"},{"x":0.545,"y":0.65548,"w":0.02518,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"= 2"},{"x":0.59757,"y":0.65548,"w":0.29005,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx dy = 2(area inside the unit circle) = 2p."},{"x":0.5726,"y":0.66699,"w":0.02251,"h":0.01952,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"O R"},{"x":0.0871,"y":0.69787,"w":0.23471,"h":0.04298,"fs":0.01151,"n":4,"k":1,"t":"FIGURE 16.32 The vector field in Example 3 has a counterclockwise circulation of 2p around the unit circle."},{"x":0.36258,"y":0.69963,"w":0.41426,"h":0.01281,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"Figure 16.32 displays the vector field and circulation around C."},{"x":0.39203,"y":0.715,"w":0.21882,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"The two sides of Equation (4) are"},{"x":0.57958,"y":0.73721,"w":0.02667,"h":0.00943,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"t=2p"},{"x":0.44976,"y":0.75012,"w":0.10485,"h":0.01346,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"M dy - N dx ="},{"x":0.60629,"y":0.75012,"w":0.28745,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"(cos t - sin t)(cos t dt) - (cos t)(-sin t dt)"},{"x":0.43016,"y":0.76163,"w":0.01791,"h":0.01952,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"F C"},{"x":0.57222,"y":0.76547,"w":0.01862,"h":0.00943,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"t=0"},{"x":0.57964,"y":0.79092,"w":0.01377,"h":0.00943,"fs":0.00895,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"2p"},{"x":0.57228,"y":0.80003,"w":0.11215,"h":0.02859,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":0,"t":"0 cos2 t dt = p"},{"x":0.4219,"y":0.84012,"w":0.02877,"h":0.01999,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"a0M"},{"x":0.43406,"y":0.84012,"w":0.15704,"h":0.04079,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"k":0,"t":"0x + 0N 0y b dx dy = O R"},{"x":0.59355,"y":0.84988,"w":0.09058,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":0,"t":"(1 + 0) dx dy"},{"x":0.3953,"y":0.86139,"w":0.02251,"h":0.01952,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"O R"},{"x":0.5894,"y":0.90359,"w":0.07474,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"k":1,"t":"dx dy = p."},{"x":0.56444,"y":0.9151,"w":0.02251,"h":0.01952,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"k":1,"t":"O R"}]}